<title>USA: Globalstar to sell $200 mln in junk bonds.</title>
<headline>Globalstar to sell $200 mln in junk bonds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Globalstar LP announced on Monday that it plans to sell $200 million in seven-year senior notes in the 144a private placement market.</p>
<p>Bear Stearns &amp; Co Inc will be the lead-underwriter of the high-yield bond offering, a market source said.</p>
<p>The company said it will use the proceeds from the offering to develop, construct and deploy its worldwide, low-earth orbit satellite-based digital telecommunications system.</p>
</text>
